Subject: [PATCH] configure.ac: remove AM_PO_SUBDIRS

Rebased to gphoto2 2.5.32 (AM_PO_SUBDIRS moved from line 46 to 73 and
the surrounding GP_GETTEXT blocks changed shape).

Upstream-Status: Pending

---
 configure.ac | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/configure.ac b/configure.ac
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/configure.ac
+++ b/configure.ac
@@ -70,7 +70,6 @@
 GP_GETTEXT_SETUP([GETTEXT_PACKAGE_GPHOTO2],
                  [gphoto2],
                  [po])
